#12900
Xiaoming tempest~
Xiaoming~
A beautiful tempest eyes you seductively.
~
Face painted stark-white, with rosy red cheeks and deep black-painted liquid
eyes, Xiaoming is a very beautiful lady, indeed. Delicate, silken eyelashes
shutter extraordinary black eyes, and her hair is neatly-trimmed to ear-
length. She wears a low-cut, long, black kimono with a golden dragon on it,
and its snaky body wraps around the entire length. Xiaoming is a seductress,
and an assassin for the Liu'she Ch'uan Tong; her beauty combined with near-
perfect skill makes her an incredibly dangerous foe.
~
