#12901
Lin Yao~
Lin Yao~
Lin Yao stands here adorned in jade.
~
Her name means "Beautiful Jade Treasure", and she lives up to her name. Lin
Yao's hair is done up with a green jade hairpin, and her short fingers are
adorned in jaded rings of the highest value. She is wearing a black veil
partially hiding the beauty behind it. Lin Yao is the twin of Ming Yue, and
their features are identical: the thin, pouty lips; the short frame; the pale
white skin, which gives off a pearlescent gleam in the darkness.
~
