#12902
Ming Yue~
Ming Yue~
Ming Yue beams in the darkness.
~
Her name means "Bright Moon", and her personality definately reflects it. She
has a happy-go-lucky attitude on life, and is terribly embarassed at the
things that go in within the Tong hideout - her home. She is Lin Yao's twin
sister, and aside from the difference of her personality, her facial features
are almost exactly the same as her sister's. She is wearing an off-white dress
with a variety of symbols that you do not understand. Her fine black eyelashes
curl exquisitely and her pale skin gives you the impression that she doesn't
get out very often.
~
