#12903
Tatsuya~
Tatsuya~
Tatsuya rests with his hands over a gnarled staff.
~
Tatsuya is an old man - he was a small child when the Tong was first founded,
and has worked his way up. He now oversees the largest operations of the
criminal organization; Seiji picked the right man for the job. He is an
utterly ruthless and sinister man, his tactics usually involving bloodshed and
and torture. His old age denys him the pleasure however, as he usually gets
the younger members of the Tong to carry out his deeds for him.
~
