Seiji man~
Seiji~
An old man is smoking a pipe here.
~
Seiji's name means "Sage" in his tounge, and he certainly lives up to his
title. Unlike most old people, Seiji has gained more knowledge over his
seemingly endless lifespan rather than forgotten. He is a short man, standing
about five and a half feet, and wears a thick embroidered robe with the Tong
symbol of a snake-like golden dragon on it.
~
