Tensui~
Tensui~
Tensui stands here, awaiting his orders.
~
Born and bred for assassination, Tensui is adorned in various weapons of
all shapes and sizes. He is skilled in virtually every form of combat, and
serves as Tatsuya's personal bodyguard and assassin. He is the father of
the twins Lin Yao and Ming Yue. Their mother died decades ago of some very
peculiar circumstances; she was prying too much in Tong affairs.
~
