Kumiko Akimoto~
Kumiko Akimoto~
Kumiko Akimoto is here, overseeing the smuggling operations.
~
His mother and father were extremely poor, and so he was sold into
slavery at a very young age. Kumiko Akimoto was raised as a member of
the Tong orginization, his sole purpose in life to oversee the goings
on of the smuggling of stolen goods. At his waist he wears the sash
with the Liu'she Ch'uan Tong insignia on it, and in his hand is a
seven-sectioned whip chain to keep his underlings in line.
~
