Ayumi Matsuo elder~
Ayumi Matsuo~
An elder eyes you through the thick smoke.
~
Ayumi Matsuo has been a member of the Tong hierarchy for decades. He is
a ruthless leader, the punishment of choice usually death, or if he's in
a good mood, torture. Ayumi wears a colorful robe with a snake-like dragon
on it, and another symbol which probably signifies leadership. He has long,
grey hair, tied in the back, which extends to his lower torso. His frail-
looking frame is the perfect camouflage for the element of surprise.
~
