Ayaka Misaki~
Ayaka Misaki~
Ayaka Misaki sits with her legs spread.
~
She is wearing a long, black dress and has her hair up with two pins. Ayaka
Misaki is the chief Tong assassin; her rank even above the notorious Miyuki
Nakazaki. She's sitting very unladylike, exposing her sex through lace
stockings that match her dress. Ayaka's face is ceremoniously painted: white
all over, red cheeks, deep black eyes. You see the hilt of what appears to
be a dagger, although you are unsure - it could be any number of things
knowing this particular lady.
~
