#12913
Daiki~
Daiki~
Daiki winks at you with one malicious eye.
~
Daiki is a large man, his rolls of fat grotesquely bulging from his jet black
garments. He is wearing a patch over his left eye, and bares a scar the length
of his right cheek. The Tong torturer, Daiki takes his job very seriously: he
is holding a spiked whip; he has a brass knuckles-like apparatus on his right
hand where the knuckles have a multitude of poisoned needles on them; and a
dagger can be seen sheathed to his bulbous right forearm.
~
