#12914
Kentu Kazuki~
Kentu Kazuki~
Kentu Kazuki glares at you over faded, dangerous eyebrows.
~
Kentu Kazuki is a very young man; he was at one point a monk for the city
of Kir-Oshi until one night Seiji used his superior intellect in a debate
after he spied Kentu in a bar fight. The end result was the newest member
of the Tong organization. Since then, Kentu has excelled in everything that
has to do with fighting because of the oneness he learned in his short time
as a monk. Kentu is wearing a simple robe with long, black hair pulled back
into a ponytail. His eyes and nose are both pierced several times, and he is
wielding a pair of sais that twinkle slightly in the darkness.
~
