#12915
Aki Kuroda~
Aki Kuroda~
Aki Kuroda stands here, painting a lovely picture.
~
Aki Kuroda is one of the many sources of money for the Tong. He is a painter,
and a very good one indeed. He doesn't do any original works, however; he is
a forger, copying rare and sacred works of art to sell on the black market.
He is wearing a simple black robe which has been splattered several different
colors of paint. Aki is sporting a very stylish and artistic goatee, which
juts from his chiselled chin.
~
