Jen Tsung~
Jen Tsung~
Jen Tsung stands here, overseeing the counterfeiting operations.
~
Tattooed on his massive left arm is the Tong insignia. Jen Tsung is a
very powerful and rich man, as evidenced by the golden piercings and
rings covering his ears and fingers. He is the overseer of the Tong
counterfeiting operations, and is wielding a seven-sectioned whip chain
to keep his slow and weak underlings in line. His hair is long and black,
tied in the back, and reaches nearly to the small of his back. A ruthless
and cunning fighter, Jen Tsung excells at his jobs: preventing you from
accessing the Tong treasure, and keeping his workers in line.
~
